# ============================================================
# Nexas — front end
# ============================================================

# The API lives here but is deployed from its own repository, so it is
# kept out of this push. Remove this line if you ever want Render to
# build the backend straight from this repo — it can only deploy what
# GitHub can see.
backend/

# The operator console. Kept out of the public site on purpose: it is
# for staff, and anything deployed alongside the trading app is one
# guessed URL away from being found. Run it locally, or host it
# separately behind your own access control.
admin/

# ---- dependencies ----
node_modules/
.pnp/
.pnp.js

# ---- local env and secrets ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---- editor and OS noise ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# ---- logs and scratch ----
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.cache/
tmp/
temp/
probe*.html          # throwaway harness pages used while testing

# NOTE: dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored. dist/preview.html is the
# single-file build produced by `node build.js` and is tracked on
# purpose, so the whole interface can be shared as one link.

# Screenshots and recordings dropped in for reference, never part of the site
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.mp4
/*.mov
